meta {
  name: auth
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  better-auth, served by the backend under /api/auth (the web app proxies the same path).

  Typical flow: sign up, open the verification link that the backend prints in its console (SMTP_HOST empty), then sign in. Sign in stores the session token as `accessToken`, which the other folders send as a bearer token.

  Two users are needed to try the visitor endpoints: fill in the `local` environment for the list's owner and `local-visitor` for the other person, and sign in again after switching.
}
